!! Multifrontal direct solver (METHOD=DIRECTmf) in eigenvalue analysis (TYPE=EIGEN): the
!! shifted matrix is factorized once and solved repeatedly during the Lanczos iterations.
!! The mesh and the reference eigenvalues are shared byte for byte with
!! tests/with_mumps/eigen/exK.
!SOLUTION, TYPE=EIGEN
!EIGEN
 3
!BOUNDARY
  FIX, 1, 6,     0.0
!!
!! SOLVER CONTROL
!!
!SOLVER,METHOD=DIRECTmf,ITERLOG=NO,TIMELOG=YES
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
!WRITE,RESULT
!END
